The Petitioner, thereafter, filed an application, from which the instant proceedings arise, before the Adjudicating Authority contending that:
(1) the quorum of the Adjudicating Authority is not functional in terms of Section 2 of the PMLA, 2002;
(2) that the Petitioner has not been supplied with a copy of 'Reasons to Believe' by the Respondent/Enforcement Directorate because of which the Provisional Attachment Order has been passed under Section 5(1) of the PMLA.
